# Ice Cream Kitty, "{2}, Sacrifice another creature or token: Draw a card. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot1 has Dori (a creature that makes a Treasure token), the
# Kitty and five Moxen. On turn 3 the Treasure token (not a creature) is sacrificed for one card; with that ability still on the stack no second one can be
# activated (CR 307.1, sorcery timing); once it has resolved, Dori (a creature) is sacrificed for another. The cost refuses a Mox (an artifact that is neither a
# creature nor a token) and the Kitty itself ("another").

